{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Divvy 是一款把儲蓄目標視覺化的儲蓄追蹤工具，適合想為多個目標分開存錢的用家，也適合希望從小教導孩子建立儲蓄習慣的家長。它把一個真實儲蓄帳戶在應用內虛擬劃分成多個存錢罐，讓每個目標的進度一目瞭然。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>一個帳戶劃分多個虛擬存錢罐</h2>\n<p>Divvy 讓你把一個真實儲蓄帳戶虛擬拆分成多個自訂存錢罐，為單車、演唱會門票或夢想旅程各自記錄進度，資金無須分散存放。分配金額後，色彩鮮明的視覺化畫面會隨存款逐步增長，存錢過程變得直觀又有推動力。介面對兒童友善，適閤家長與孩子一同使用，在遊戲化體驗中建立儲蓄習慣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-373-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-374-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-375-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-376-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-377-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-378-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Divvy – Savings Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T02:20:05.223551+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}